WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.340
In luxury homes, every detail matters, especially what you see outside.

2
00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:09.000
We are MirageVision, and this is what outdoor entertainment should look like.

3
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:13.600
This display is built with advanced MIP and GOB technology.

4
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:19.820
MIP allows the screen to operate in extreme temperatures, making it ideal

5
00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:23.270
for desert climates like Utah and Nevada.

6
00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:27.570
GOB technology protects the individual LEDs by encapsulating them,

7
00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:29.870
helping prevent damage from impact, moisture,

8
00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:35.650
and outdoor elements, which is crucial in an exterior installation like this.

9
00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:39.690
This product is featured in the 2026 St. George Parade of Homes.

10
00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:42.400
Reach out to us for more information.

11
00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:46.200
[Music]
